<title>UK: S&amp;P affirms Equitable Life Assurance rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Equitable Life Assurance rating.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's rating agency said on Wednesday it had affirmed the claims paying ability of Equitable Life Assurance Society of the U.S. at AA minus.</p>
<p>The action followed a number of rating revisions to insurance companies made by S&amp;P earlier, including Axa and UAP.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 54 8682</p>
</text>
